  "description": "Orelle sits in the Maurienne valley on the south side of the mountains \u2014 the 'fourth valley' access to Les 3 Vall\u00e9es. The 3 Vall\u00e9es Express gondola reaches Val Thorens in 13 minutes (new cable car in 2021). 85% of slopes above 1,800m. 3 peaks over 3,000m: Pointe du Bouchet (3,230m), Cime Caron (3,195m), Col de Rosa\u00ebl (3,000m). Free parking at gondola base. HOB Orelle (new 2024) \u2014 hotel, dormitories, restaurant. 740 covered parking spaces (2025). Direct shuttle from Saint-Michel-de-Maurienne station. Originally a mining village \u2014 transformed into a ski resort in 1996 with the 3 Vall\u00e9es Express gondola.",
